{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>You guided in Your kindness.</b> He said נחית in the past tense in place of the future, as is the rule of prophecies." "And the meaning of בחסדכה is concerning the pillars of cloud and fire, for He it is who guides them, or this is an allusion to that which He guided until now." "<b>You led.</b> Like אתנהלה לאטי (Genesis 33 [33:14])." "<b>In Your might.</b> And not in their might." "<b>To the abode of Your holiness.</b> This is Mount Sinai, for there the Glory dwelled, and likewise it is written, ואביא אתכם אלי (below, 19:4)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:46.049540340Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}